Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is an independent Haskell implementation that reproduces the
observable behaviour of the pinned Petrus Python reference (see UPSTREAM.md
at the repository root). Its schema text, SQL statements, payload formats,
identity derivations and error messages are reproduced from that reference
so that both implementations share one PostgreSQL database and call and
spawn each other. The acceptance demo reproduces the reference's
scripts/cv5-lifecycle-demo.py. The driver scripts in test/interop and bench
run the reference itself from the pinned upstream virtual environment.

